OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's external workforce
OL,4,Aspending falls again
OL,5,
OL,6,FMoney spent by the government on
OL,7,Ftemporary workers and consultancy fees
OL,8,Fin the first half of 2026 has fallen by
OL,9,Fmore than #22m compared with 2023.
OL,11,FIn a new report, the Government of
OL,12,FJersey revealed it had spent #16.7m on
OL,13,Fconsultants, contingency workers, and
OL,14,Fagency staff from January to June, down
OL,15,F58% from #39.6m during the same period
OL,16,Fthree years ago.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
