OL,3,GNEWSAJersey's external workforce
OL,4,Aspending falls again
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, the amount spent on
OL,7,Fcontingency workers alone, such as
OL,8,Fnon-permanent workers of contractors,
OL,9,Fhad jumped from #4.6m in the first half
OL,10,Fof 2025 to #6.2m this year, the report
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FThe government said this was down to
OL,14,Fattempts to "improve cyber security,
OL,15,Fmodernise critical systems and to
OL,16,Freplace ageing infrastructure".
